abstract = {We would like to take this opportunity to welcome you to the 6th International Workshop on Realizing Artificial Intelligence Synergies in Software Engineering (RAISE 2018), which is co-located with the 40th International Conference on Software Engineering (ICSE 2018) and will be held in Gothenburg, Sweden on 27th May 2018.The RAISE workshops provide a platform for discussion of the synergies between Artificial Intelligence and Software Engineering, and also help to raise awareness of this work within the wider community. We hope that RAISE 2018 will encourage a growing number of researchers to join this area.},
